# Surfing the Net in a General Studies Interdisciplinary Humanities Course.

**Authors:** Mehl, James V.

## Abstract
Addresses some of the results from the Funding For Results (FFR) program at Missouri Western State College that introduced specific Internet searches and communication of the results of that student research. Explains that the FFR's instructional interventions may be of interest to teachers of introductory courses especially in the humanities. (CMK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ610530

